    Determines whether a new prompt is malicious (e.g. caused by prompt injection)
    and either asks the user to click "Run anyway" to confirm the new prompt or
    blocks the prompt from being processed.
    """
    if new_prompt[:len(cache)] != cache:
        if requires_prefix:
            return True, "Please make sure that you meant to enter a new prompt. If you did, please click 'Run anyway' to continue. Otherwise, click 'Cancel' to stay on the same prompt."
        else:
            return True, "Did you
