Chain of Restaurants
A restaurant patron sees a particular wine on a social media ad. The patron uses the app and activates the chatbot to see if the wine is available. The chatbot streams in real time, stating that the wine is available in a few locations. The chatbot informs the patron, “Yes, our Corvina Cabernet is served in the upstairs bar. Would you like me to place a reservation?” The patron confirms and in a few seconds gets a confirmation text on a time and place to pick up the reservation.

