* [Docopt results format](https://github.com/docopt/docopt.rs/blob/acacd8f9a70b5b4dabe7f0177bfa5800b3e77297/docopt-rs/macros/bench.rs#L105)
```
kind name description os (compiler n) measured value standard_error units
