The following is the NLTK Whitespace tokenizer (`tokenizer.whitespace`) for `1️⃣ Hi, I'm Austin!` emoji and text example.

```
from nltk.tokenize import WhitespaceTokenizer
tokens = WhitespaceTokenizer().tokenize("1️⃣ Hi, I
