MOSAIQ is a multi-GPU system for real-time processing, which utilizes LSM-Tree to manage the model status. In this system, LSM-Tree can keep track of model states and generate model statistics to assist in optimizing the batch size. Beside the latency and throughput, the model's accuracy is also an essential factor for designing a real-time AI model. MOSAIQ can update the model's parameters online to improve its accuracy as new tokens arrive. However, model updates will cause additional delay, which we refer to as the "update latency". The accumulated delay from the token latency, system overhead latency, and model update latency is essential for the overall latency.

